  "description": "(3.2.0) SignalR-based multiplayer collaboration hub for the CircleAI substrate. Lift from CircleUp's CollabHub — \"note\" generalised to \"document\", IOwnerProvider replaced with a host-supplied IMultiplayerPeerIdentity. Per-doc rooms with last-writer-wins on the body + live cursor positions + presence. Covers the 95% case of \"two people in the same doc at the same time\" without paying the cost of a real CRDT port.",
